<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_26__subsec_2> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_26> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
