<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_3__para_b> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#paragraph> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_3__para_b> <https://schema.org/text> "Bank menerima suatu representasi, Bank hendaklah, selepas mempertimbang representasi itu, memberi pemproses mata wang berdaftar itu suatu notis mengenai keputusannya sama ada untuk meneruskan pembatalan pendaftaran itu atau sebaliknya."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_4> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "4" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_4> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_4> <https://schema.org/text> "Suatu pembatalan pendaftaran di bawah subseksyen (3) hendaklah berkuat kuasa pada tarikh yang ditentukan oleh Bank dalam notisnya di bawah subseksyen (3)."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_5> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "5" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_5> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#subsection> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_31__subsec_5> <https://schema.org/text> "Jika Bank memutuskan di bawah perenggan (3)(b) untuk tidak membatalkan pendaftaran pemproses mata wang berdaftar itu, Bank boleh mengenakan apa-apa kehendak ke atas pemproses mata wang berdaftar itu yang difikirkan patut oleh Bank. Kesan pembatalan pendaftaran"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_32> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_IV__cl_32__subsec_1> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
