<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_V__cl_46__para_a> <https://schema.org/text> "apa-apa peruntukan Akta ini; atau"@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
