<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_V__cl_49> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_V__cl_49__para_c> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_V__cl_49> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#has_part> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_V__cl_49__para_d> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_V__cl_49> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#is_part_of> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_V> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_V__cl_49> <http://data.europa.eu/eli/ontology#number> "49" <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@/~part_V__cl_49> <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#type> <http://docs.oasis-open.org/legaldocml/ns/akn/3.0#clause> <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/2019/29/msa@> .
